  "introduction": "Develop Primary 3 skills in perimeter of composite shapes.",
  "definition": "Perimeter is the total length around the outside boundary. For a composite polygon, find missing lengths from matching horizontal or vertical distances, then add every outside side once. Do not count internal shared edges.",
